{
  // Screen 15 - Card Collection (GDD §11). Rects are mockup pixels on 15-card-styles.png.
  // Shared menu background and UI kit (large panel, deck option panels = UI_Panel_Card, primary
  // button, header discs). The deck pictures are the real card backs (Art/Cards), shown with their
  // own proportions inside the mockup's card boxes; the presenter flips them to each deck's ace of
  // spades. Cut here (placeholders until the generated kit replaces them): the card-stack icon, the
  // selected outline, the two radio looks, and the soft shadows under the deck pictures.
  // Footer and button copy: the GDD's copy update wins ("text" below is the GDD's wording, so the
  // string table gets it). The mockup says "Choose a card back for your next match." and "Use
  // Selected Style"; CardCollectionCustomizer fits the two labels on that wording, so they keep the
  // mockup's size, width scale, baseline and centre, and the width follows the new text.
  "name": "CardCollection",
  "mockup": "15-card-styles.png",
  "background": "shared",
  "nodes": [
